@startuml
participant Runner
participant Validator
participant OwnershipGate
participant OriginalChecks
Runner -> Validator: --all exact candidate
Validator -> OwnershipGate: original paths + explicit extension catalog
OwnershipGate --> Validator: reject unknown or continue
Validator -> OriginalChecks: execute complete accepted suite
OriginalChecks --> Runner: evidence and status
@enduml
